<Site title="Research | Tianxu Peng" description="Research on phase optimization and unimodular waveforms for joint radar and communications.">
  <h1>Research</h1>
  <section>
    <h2>Waveforms for joint radar and communications</h2>
    <p>I study how phase optimization can embed communication symbols in radar waveforms while controlling correlation sidelobes.</p>
    <p><a href="/publications/#peng2026-embedding">Flexible phase-adjusted information embedding</a><br /><a href="/publications/#peng2026-phase">Joint design for correlation and information embedding</a></p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Waveforms with discrete phases</h2>
    <p>I study how to design sets of constant-modulus waveforms with low auto- and cross-correlation when each sample must use one of a finite set of phases.</p>
    <p><a href="/publications/#peng2026-discrete">Multi-waveform design over arbitrary discrete phases</a></p>
  </section>
</Site>
